ent-Wirecutter = Wirecutter | wirecutter
    .desc = 這會使電線失效。 | This kills the wire.
ent-Screwdriver = 螺絲起子 screwdriver | screwdriver
    .desc = 小巧的螺絲起子機身，卻具備工業級扭力。 | Industrial grade torque in a small screwdriving package.
ent-Wrench = 扳手 | wrench
    .desc = 一種常用的組裝與拆卸工具。請記住：向左轉是鎖緊，向右轉是拆卸。 | A common tool for assembly and disassembly. Remember: lefty latchy, righty removey.
ent-Multitool = 多功能工具 | multitool
    .desc = 一種先進的工具，用於複製、儲存及透過電線和機器傳送電脈衝與訊號。 | An advanced tool to copy, store, and send electrical pulses and signals through wires and machines.
ent-NetworkConfigurator = 網路設定工具 | network configurator
    .desc = 一款用於將裝置相互連結的工具。具備兩種模式：用於批量連結裝置的「清單模式」，以及用於進階裝置連結的「連結模式」。 | A tool for linking devices together. Has two modes, a list mode for mass linking devices and a linking mode for advanced device linking.
ent-PowerDrill = 電鑽 | power drill
    .desc = 一款簡單的電動手鑽。 | A simple powered hand drill.
ent-RCD = RCD | RCD
    .desc = 此快速施工裝置可用於迅速安裝及拆除各類站體結構與固定裝置。運作時需使用壓縮氣體。 | The rapid construction device can be used to quickly place and remove various station structures and fixtures. Requires compressed matter to function.
ent-RCDEmpty = { ent-RCD }
    .desc = { ent-RCD.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-RCDRecharging = 實驗性 RCD | experimental RCD
    .desc = 一種安裝於賽博格身上的快速建造裝置，可透過內建的製造器即時生成壓縮物質。 | Cyborg-mounted Rapid Construction Device which creates compressed matter on the fly using an internal fabricator.
    .suffix = AutoRecharge
ent-RCDExperimental = 實驗性 RCD | experimental RCD
    .desc = 一種經「藍空間」增強的快速建造裝置，能被動地自行生成壓縮物質。 | A bluespace-enhanced rapid construction device that passively generates its own compressed matter.
    .suffix = Admeme
ent-RCDAmmo = 壓縮物質 | compressed matter
    .desc = 一顆透過「藍色空間」技術壓製而成的原料彈匣。用於快速建造裝置。 | A cartridge of raw matter compacted by bluespace technology. Used in rapid construction devices.
ent-Omnitool = omnitool | omnitool
    .desc = 無人機的最佳夥伴。 | A drone's best friend.
ent-Shovel = 鏟子 | shovel
    .desc = 一種用於挖掘和搬運泥土的大型工具。 | A large tool for digging and moving dirt.
ent-RollingPin = 擀麵棍 | rolling pin
    .desc = 一種用於塑形和壓平麵糰的工具。 | A tool used to shape and flatten dough.
